WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,960
You found a way to turn your lightsaber around

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,320
But my physical strength and control didn’t keep up.

3
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:06,080
Only train when I urge you to

4
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:08,140
Find the best direction

5
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:10,190
Can't use it either

6
00:00:13,590 --> 00:00:15,430
The turning sword you just had was very powerful.

7
00:00:15,870 --> 00:00:16,830
Practice a few more times

8
00:00:17,110 --> 00:00:18,430
Definitely can hit three swords

9
00:00:18,910 --> 00:00:20,510
I always felt that Ji Chuan was there before

10
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:22,180
Really in danger

11
00:00:22,890 --> 00:00:24,410
It’s not my turn to be in front

12
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:26,400
starting from tomorrow

13
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:28,720
I train with Xiaomei every day during the day

14
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:30,660
Not waiting for Ji Chuanhan

15
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:32,620
I practice it myself

16
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:35,740
The meal is ready. Let’s eat first.

17
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:37,140
Recover and practice again
